title: "BLEND: Function localization on the regular Cartesian grid"
type: software
version: "2.0.1"
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/cascadiaquakes/blend"
authors:
  - family-names: Ajala
    given-names: Rasheed
    affiliation: "Lamont-Doherty Earth Observatory, Columbia University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5650-8362"
  - name: "CRESCENT cyberinfrastructure team"
    website: "https://cascadiaquakes.org/"
abstract: "BLEND is a library and collection of command-line programs for localizing functions using arbitrarily shaped support on the regular Cartesian grid. Applications include filter design, spectral analysis, and the synthesis (merging) of multidimensional models and datasets."
